# --- Captured snapshots ---
# Map data is binary and changes daily. It MUST NOT enter git history:
# committing ~40 MB/day is what inflated the reference project to 2 GB.
# Snapshots are published to the `data` orphan branch / Releases instead.
capture-output/
web/public/data/
*.height.bin
*.albedo.jpg
*.bin.gz

